# The Hermes API key / URL are NOT committed here on purpose.
# This file only documents which env vars backtalk's shim reads.
#
#   HERMES_API_URL  OpenAI-compatible base, e.g. http://127.0.0.1:8642/v1
#   HERMES_API_KEY  36-char secret set in Part 1
#   HERMES_MODEL    (optional) model id, default "hermes"
#
# No values are stored in this repo.